      "y": 90,
      "width": 313.5686950683594,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "final / static / abstract rules\n• final class: cannot extend\n• final method: cannot override\n• static/private/final: not redefinable\n• cannot be abstract & non-overridable\n\nFunctional interface: 1 abstract method",
